{"nodes": [{"id": "readme_rosarcana", "label": "Rosarcana: la guerra dei Sigilli", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Browser TCG with a gothic cathedral flavour; the whole design is oriented to desktop play (below 1100px the page scrolls rather than reflowing) to keep the three-lane board readable."}, {"id": "readme_sigilli", "label": "Sigilli (three lanes, three seals per side)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Win condition is breaking two of the opponent's three Seals \u2014 chosen over a single life total so lanes matter individually and mechanics like Aggirare and Rintocco have something to hook into."}, {"id": "readme_cristalli", "label": "Cristalli (permanent crystal ramp)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 3-4, 122", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One extra permanent Crystal per turn up to 10, then two cards drawn per turn; games start from 1 Crystal so the opening is slow and readable for new players."}, {"id": "readme_vite_react_ts", "label": "Vite + React 18 + TypeScript stack", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 39", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Components organised per feature, with types shared between engine and interface."}, {"id": "readme_framer_motion", "label": "Framer Motion animation layer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 40-42", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "MTG Arena style animations without hand-written animation code; AnimatePresence for exits and spring attacks."}, {"id": "readme_layoutid_card", "label": "Stable layoutId card-<id>", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 40", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each card keeps a stable layoutId so the same card element flies hand -> stack -> lane automatically; avoids writing manual animation code for every transition."}, {"id": "readme_zustand_stores", "label": "Zustand stores (profile + battle)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 43-44", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Split into profile/store.ts (collection, currencies, decks, persisted in the browser) and features/battle/store.ts (match state plus the animation director)."}, {"id": "readme_engine_puro", "label": "engine/ pure rules engine", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 51", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rules, effects and AI kept free of React so the engine is portable to a server (and it was in fact ported to C# for rosarcana-unity)."}, {"id": "readme_economy", "label": "economy/ packs, odds, pity, rewards, decks", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 52", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_d3_delaunay", "label": "d3-delaunay glass tessellation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 45", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Used to generate the glass tiles of the Vetrata (stained glass) card style procedurally."}, {"id": "readme_tone_js", "label": "Tone.js synthesized audio", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 45", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_set_base", "label": "Set Base (120 cards)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 77-78, 130-131", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Grew 60 -> 72 -> 120 cards (44 common, 32 uncommon, 28 rare, 16 legendary), 30 per Casata, balanced with AI simulations keeping factions between 48% and 53% win rate at every deck level."}, {"id": "readme_casata_brace", "label": "Casata Brace (ember/forge faction)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 135", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_casata_marea", "label": "Casata Marea (tide/sea faction)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 135", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_casata_radice", "label": "Casata Radice (root/forest faction)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 135", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_casata_vuoto", "label": "Casata Vuoto (void faction)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 135", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_signori_di_casata", "label": "Signori di Casata (tribal lords)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 135", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One lord per faction grants a faction-shaped buff (Brace +1 attack, Marea +1 health, Radice Linfa vitale, Vuoto Eco) so the tribal archetype has an anchor."}, {"id": "readme_aggirare", "label": "Aggirare (bypass a defended lane)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 133", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "If the lane is defended the attack hits an adjacent uncovered Seal \u2014 a Rosarcana-original keyword that exploits the three-lane board instead of copying evasion from other TCGs."}, {"id": "readme_offerta", "label": "Offerta N (pay with your own Seal's life)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 133-134", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cost paid from the healthiest of your own Seals, creating a tension between tempo and the two-Seal loss condition."}, {"id": "readme_auspicio", "label": "Auspicio (+1/+1 in lanes with an omen)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 134", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_rintocco", "label": "Rintocco (trigger when your Seal breaks)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 134", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Turns losing a Seal into a comeback resource, so the board state that ends the game also fuels resistance."}, {"id": "readme_ultimo_rintocco", "label": "Ultimo Rintocco (faction death-rattle)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 168-169", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When a Seal breaks the deck's main faction answers once (Rogo finale, Ultima risacca, Radici profonde, Patto finale); each Custode also has a personal one."}, {"id": "readme_veleno", "label": "Veleno keyword", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 120, 134", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_linfa_vitale", "label": "Linfa vitale keyword", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 120, 134", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_volo", "label": "Volo keyword (removed)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 120, 134", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Introduced alongside Veleno and Linfa vitale, then cut: Aggirare covers the evasion role in a way that fits the lane/Seal board better."}, {"id": "readme_ascesa", "label": "Ascesa (+2/+2 after surviving 2 combats)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 170", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_sincronie", "label": "Sincronie (14 lore-linked card pairs)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 164-165", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pairs bound by the lore (Lupa Grigia + Orsa Madre, Il Primo Fuoco + Fenice Minore) reward flavour-coherent deckbuilding; implemented in engine/mechanics.ts."}, {"id": "readme_presagi_di_corsia", "label": "Presagi di corsia (lane omens)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 166-167", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three random omens per match (Nebbia, Terra consacrata, Vento di cenere, Eclissi, Radici antiche, Campane a morto) add per-game variance; deliberately disabled in the tutorial to stay predictable."}, {"id": "readme_custodi_del_sigillo", "label": "Custodi del Sigillo (8 deck heroes)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 171-173", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two per faction, inspired by myth figures (Vesta, Prometeo, Cassandra, Odisseo, l'Uomo Verde, Demetra, Caronte, Ecate); each has an always-on effect plus a personal Ultimo Rintocco, chosen in the deck editor."}, {"id": "readme_maestria", "label": "Maestria (card mastery ranks)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 174, 117-119", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cards rank up by being played and by challenges; each rank unlocks an ornate frame, moved from the card to the profile portrait so the card art stays uncluttered."}, {"id": "readme_mulligan", "label": "Mulligan", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 90-91", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One-shot replacement before the first turn; the AI heuristic replaces cards costing 5 or more."}, {"id": "readme_codici_mazzo", "label": "Deck codes RDECK1:", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "line 92", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_accessibilita", "label": "Options and accessibility", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 93-94", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Text size, reduced motion, high contrast, three font choices (Gotico, Leggibile, Elegante) and volume; every animation honours the reduced-motion preference."}, {"id": "readme_replay", "label": "Replay system", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 104-105", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every match is recorded move by move so it can be replayed from the end screen or the Profile with a scrub bar."}, {"id": "readme_sfide_settimanali", "label": "Sfide della settimana", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 106-107", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_avventura_della_rosa", "label": "Avventura della Rosa", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 73-74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Official chapters; the author writes further ones in Modalita autore and exports them, registering them in OFFICIAL_EXTRA so publishing does not require engine changes."}, {"id": "readme_racconti_community", "label": "Racconti della community (voted serials)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 79-82, 95-96", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Moderators write chapters, the community votes 2-4 options and the closing option can carry a 7-day event. Data is split so stories/<id> is moderator-write and ballots/<user-id> is self-write only, which makes the shared artifact database safe without a server; without a database it degrades to local."}, {"id": "readme_modes", "label": "Game modes (Arena, Spedizione, Allenamento, Prove)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 83-84, 124-125", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Arena delle Rose (draft), Spedizione (roguelike), Allenamento and three guided Prove della Rosa; Adventure, Shop, Pass and competitive modes stay locked until the tutorial and the Prove are done \u2014 a deliberate guided first hour."}, {"id": "readme_leggendarie_reveal", "label": "Legendary entrance reveal", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 141-143", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each of the 16 legendaries gets faction-coloured rays, a name card and its own sound motif (LEGEND_VOICE in audio/sfx.ts); rays vanish under Reduce animations."}, {"id": "readme_tempo_del_turno", "label": "Turn clock (TURN_SECONDS / RESERVE_SECONDS)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 157-160", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "75s per turn plus a 60s match-long reserve; animations do not consume time and teaching modes are untimed, so the clock never punishes learning or slow rendering."}, {"id": "readme_mano_rivelata", "label": "Revealed hand (HandCard.known)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 152-154", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Occhio Vacuo flips cards to known and they stay face-up at the top of the table until played, with an eye marker on your own cards the opponent has seen \u2014 information is made persistent and symmetric instead of a one-off peek."}, {"id": "readme_personalizzazione_carte", "label": "Card customization (Stile, Effetti, Cornice)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 188-198", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three independent cosmetic axes rather than monolithic skins; legacy saves are migrated (old golden finish becomes Olografico effect plus Dorata frame) so nothing is lost."}, {"id": "readme_stili_carta", "label": "Card styles (Dipinta, Vetrata, Incisione, Illustrata)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 114-116, 193", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All styles moved to a single full-art model with a title bar and an attack/health plate; Illustrata is free but only offered when the AI image exists, otherwise cards fall back to Vetrata."}, {"id": "readme_arte_ai", "label": "AI art pipeline (npm run art)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 200-214", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Prompts live in art/prompts.json as common style + subject + faction setting, with no artist names, text or logos; images land in src/assets/art/<id>.png and are picked up by import.meta.glob so adding art needs no code change. Provider-swappable (OpenAI or Stability)."}, {"id": "readme_nota_legale_ai", "label": "Legal note on AI-generated images", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 213-214", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "In many jurisdictions (e.g. the USA) fully AI-generated images are not covered by copyright, so others could reuse them; provider terms must also be checked. This is the stated risk of the AI art pipeline."}, {"id": "readme_game_icons_licenza", "label": "game-icons.net CC BY 3.0 attribution", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 216-220", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Procedural figures use game-icons.net icons (Lorc, Delapouite and others) under CC BY 3.0; attribution lives in the Collection screen and the mapping in art/icon-map.json regenerated via npm run icons."}, {"id": "readme_build_single", "label": "npm run build:single (single-file dist/index.html)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 21-23, 33", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bundles the whole game into one HTML file openable by double click, for demos and previews, alongside the classic static build."}, {"id": "readme_protezione_doppioni", "label": "Improved duplicate protection in packs", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 176-177", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "If a rarity is already complete the slot is promoted to the next rarity up, so packs never become dead value."}, {"id": "readme_reliquiario", "label": "Il Reliquiario (shop and pack opening)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 182-185", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Four-phase opening ritual (seal cracks, burst of light, face-down cards with a rarity aura, beam reveal) with extra gold rays for legendaries; every purchase asks for confirmation."}, {"id": "readme_codex_della_rosa", "label": "Codex della Rosa", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 97-98", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Stories of owned cards plus hidden fragments in cards/secrets.ts that unlock at the Adepto mastery rank, tying lore discovery to play."}, {"id": "readme_image_override", "label": "Image override for backs and frames", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 99-100, 109-110", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Files back-<id> and frame-<id> in src/assets/site automatically replace the code-drawn versions, so commissioned art can be dropped in without touching the drawing code; mastery frames use frame-maestria-N.webp with a transparent centre."}, {"id": "readme_archetipi_mazzi", "label": "ARCHETYPES (10 model decks)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 146-149", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Aggro, Burn, Tribale, Tempo, Prison, Control, Ramp, Midrange, Combo, Rintocco; missing cards stay flagged instead of blocking the import."}, {"id": "readme_mazzi_preimpostati", "label": "Preset starter decks", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "lines 75-76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributo